<title>USA: Lone Star backs Q1 $0.43/shr estimate.</title>
<headline>Lone Star backs Q1 $0.43/shr estimate.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon Inc is comfortable with the Montgomery Securities earnings estimate of $0.43 per share for the first quarter, chief financial officer John White said in a statement.</p>
<p>In the same year-ago period, the restaurant company posted earnings of $0.33 per share.</p>
<p>The company owns 209 domestic and 21 international Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon restaurants, two Sullivan's Steakhouse restaurants and two Del Frisco's Double Eagle Steak House restaurants.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
